<tr><td>Theveloras  staysTeam</td><td>Founders</td><td>Founded by a group of passionate travellers and hospitality enthusiasts, Theveloras  stayscreated Velora Stays with a vision to provide luxury private villa experiences near Pawna Lake. With a deep love for the Sahyadri mountains and a commitment to exceptional hospitality, the team has built Velora Stays into one of the most trusted villa properties in Lonavala.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ravi Patil</td><td>Head Caretaker</td><td>Ravi leads the caretaker team at Velora Stays with meticulous attention to detail. With over 15 years of experience in hospitality and a deep knowledge of the Lonavala region, he ensures that every guest receives personalised care and has an unforgettable experience. From arranging local activities to coordinating special events, Ravi goes above and beyond for every guest.</td></tr>
