<tr><td>8</td><td>Meera Iyer</td><td>Google</td><td>2025-11-22</td><td>The location is unbeatable for anyone visiting Pawna Lake. We could walk to the lake in 10 minutes and the sunset views from the villa terrace were stunning. The private pool was a luxury and the kitchen was well-equipped for our home-cooked meals. Highly recommended for couples.</td></tr>
