<!-- ==================== 11. FAQS ==================== -->
<h1>11. FAQS (All 40 — 8 Categories)</h1>

<h2>Category 1: Booking &amp; Reservations</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>How can I book a villa at Velora Stays?</strong> You can book directly through our website by selecting your dates, choosing your preferred villa type, and completing secure payment. Alternatively, call +91 9324248001 or WhatsApp. Also available on MakeMyTrip, Goibibo, and Airbnb.</li>
  <li><strong>Can I modify or cancel my reservation?</strong> Yes, subject to cancellation policy. Free cancellation up to 7 days before check-in. Within 7 days: one-night charge may apply.</li>
  <li><strong>Do you accept group bookings?</strong> Absolutely! Special rates available for 2+ villas. Contact reservations team at least two weeks in advance.</li>
  <li><strong>Will I receive a booking confirmation?</strong> Yes, detailed confirmation email with reservation details. If not received within 30 minutes, check spam or contact info@velorastays.in.</li>
  <li><strong>Can I request a specific villa?</strong> We do our best to accommodate, subject to availability. Mention preference while booking.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 2: Villas &amp; Accommodation</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>What types of villas are available?</strong> 4 BHK (Cozy Retreat), 5 BHK (Grand Villa), 7 BHK (Royal Estate). Each with private pool, garden, kitchen, BBQ, caretaker.</li>
  <li><strong>What is check-in/check-out time?</strong> Check-in: 2:00 PM, Check-out: 11:00 AM. Early/late available on request.</li>
  <li><strong>Are extra beds or baby cots available?</strong> Yes, at nominal charge. Inform at time of booking.</li>
  <li><strong>Is there a caretaker at the villa?</strong> Yes, dedicated caretaker available 8:00 AM - 8:00 PM. Emergency number for after-hours.</li>
  <li><strong>What amenities are included?</strong> AC, Smart TV, WiFi, fully equipped kitchen, private pool, BBQ, garden, power backup, hot water, caretaker.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 3: Kitchen &amp; BBQ</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Is there a kitchen in the villa?</strong> Yes, fully equipped with gas stove, refrigerator, microwave, utensils, cookware. Complimentary tea, coffee, sugar, cooking essentials.</li>
  <li><strong>Is BBQ equipment available?</strong> Yes, dedicated BBQ area with charcoal grill, utensils, and seating. Complimentary charcoal for first session.</li>
  <li><strong>Can you arrange a private chef?</strong> Yes, available for traditional Maharashtrian feast, BBQ dinner, or celebration meals. Inform 24 hours in advance.</li>
  <li><strong>Are there restaurants nearby?</strong> Local restaurants and dhabas within driving distance. Lonavala town is 20 minutes away.</li>
  <li><strong>Can I order food delivery?</strong> Direct delivery is limited. Caretaker can arrange meals from nearby restaurants or private chef.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 4: Location &amp; Transport</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>How far is the villa from Mumbai?</strong> ~100 km, 2.5 to 3-hour drive via Mumbai-Pune Expressway.</li>
  <li><strong>How far is the villa from Pune?</strong> ~60 km, 1.5 to 2-hour drive via Pune-Lonavala Highway.</li>
  <li><strong>Is parking available?</strong> Yes, free parking for 2-3 vehicles at each villa.</li>
  <li><strong>How do I reach the villa?</strong> By car via Mumbai-Pune Expressway. Lonavala railway station is 20 min away — pickup can be arranged.</li>
  <li><strong>Can you arrange local transport for sightseeing?</strong> Yes, caretaker can arrange transport. Curated packages covering major attractions available.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 5: Facilities &amp; Services</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Is WiFi available?</strong> Yes, complimentary high-speed WiFi in all villas and common areas.</li>
  <li><strong>Is there a swimming pool?</strong> Yes, every villa has its own private swimming pool, regularly maintained.</li>
  <li><strong>Is there a bonfire facility?</strong> Yes, bonfire setup in garden with complimentary firewood for first session.</li>
  <li><strong>Is there a concierge service?</strong> Yes, caretaker team available for transport, tours, local recommendations.</li>
  <li><strong>Is power backup available?</strong> Yes, all villas equipped with power backup generators.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 6: Events &amp; Celebrations</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Can I book the villa for a private event?</strong> Yes, perfect for birthday parties, anniversaries, pre-wedding shoots, corporate offsites. Contact events team 2 weeks in advance.</li>
  <li><strong>What event packages do you offer?</strong> Customizable packages including venue decoration, private chef, BBQ, bonfire, event coordination.</li>
  <li><strong>What is maximum capacity for events?</strong> 7 BHK: up to 25 guests seated dinner, 40 cocktail-style. 4 BHK/5 BHK: 10-20 people.</li>
  <li><strong>Do you provide catering?</strong> Yes, Maharashtrian, North Indian, Continental cuisines. Menu customization available.</li>
  <li><strong>Can I host corporate meeting/offsite?</strong> Yes, meeting spaces with projectors, screens, WiFi, tea breaks, working lunches, team-building activities.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 7: Payment &amp; Policies</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>What payment methods do you accept?</strong> Cash (INR), all major credit/debit cards, UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), net banking.</li>
  <li><strong>What is your cancellation policy?</strong> Free cancellation up to 7 days before check-in. Within 7 days: one-night charge. No-shows: full charge.</li>
  <li><strong>When will my refund be processed?</strong> Within 5-7 business days to original payment method.</li>
  <li><strong>Do you provide GST invoices?</strong> Yes, GST-compliant invoices for all stays. Provide GSTIN at time of booking.</li>
  <li><strong>Do you require a security deposit?</strong> Refundable INR 5,000 at check-in.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Category 8: Safety &amp; Security</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Is the villa equipped with CCTV?</strong> Yes, comprehensive CCTV surveillance covering all entry/exit points, parking, and common areas.</li>
  <li><strong>What security measures are in place?</strong> CCTV, trained security personnel, dedicated caretaker, secure locks, visitor verification.</li>
  <li><strong>Is the villa equipped for fire safety?</strong> Yes, smoke detectors, fire extinguishers, emergency exits, automated fire alarm system. Staff trained in evacuation procedures.</li>
  <li><strong>Is medical assistance available on site?</strong> 24/7 on-call medical assistance, first-aid kit, tie-ups with nearby hospitals.</li>
  <li><strong>What hygiene protocols do you follow?</strong> Hospital-grade disinfectants between stays, regular sanitization of common areas, hand sanitizer dispensers.</li>
</ol>

