<p><strong>Itinerary:</strong></p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>8:00 AM — Pawna Lake Boating:</strong> Scenic boat ride on Pawna Lake with views of Tikona Fort and Sahyadri mountains.</li>
  <li><strong>10:00 AM — Kayaking Experience:</strong> Kayak on serene waters with panoramic views.</li>
  <li><strong>12:00 PM — Village Visit:</strong> Visit local fishing village, learn about culture, home-cooked lunch with fresh fish.</li>
  <li><strong>2:00 PM — Guided Trek:</strong> Trek through lush green trails with lake and valley views.</li>
  <li><strong>5:00 PM — Evening by the Lake:</strong> Relax by the lake, watch sunset with tea.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Tour 2: Fort Trekking Experience</h2>
<table>
<tr><td><strong>Duration</strong></td><td>Full Day (7:00 AM - 4:00 PM)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Price</strong></td><td>₹2,000 (Original: ₹2,500)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Group Size</strong></td><td>2-12 people</td></tr>
</table>
