  <li><strong>10:00 AM — Fort Exploration:</strong> Explore Visapur Gate, Shivaji-era fortifications, water cisterns. Panoramic lake views.</li>
  <li><strong>12:00 PM — Lunch Break:</strong> Packed lunch with mountain views.</li>
  <li><strong>1:30 PM — Tikona Fort Trek:</strong> Scenic trek to Tikona Fort (1.5hr). Views of Pawna Lake.</li>
  <li><strong>4:00 PM — Tikona Fort Exploration:</strong> Explore Vinayak Temple, historic fortifications. Sunset views.</li>
</ol>

