<h2>18a. Privacy Policy</h2>
<div class="policy">
<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 15, 2026</p>
<p>Velora Stays ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website, use our booking services, or stay at our villa.</p>
<p><strong>Properties:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Villa 7 (7 BHK):</strong> 1-acre, 7 rooms with attached bathrooms + 1 common bathroom, swimming pool, garden. 4 rooms on 1st floor with hall, 3 rooms on ground floor with dining hall. Min 14 pax, Max 28 pax.</li>
  <li><strong>Villa 5 (5 BHK):</strong> 1-acre, 5 rooms with attached bathrooms + 1 common bathroom, swimming pool, garden. 4 rooms on 1st floor, 1 room on ground floor with dining room and play zone. Min 10 pax, Max 15 pax.</li>
  <li><strong>Villa 4 (4 BHK):</strong> 0.5-acre, 4 rooms with attached bathrooms + 1 common bathroom, separate dining area, swimming pool, garden. 2 cottages with 2 rooms each. Min 8 pax, Max 16 pax.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Information Collected:</strong> Full name, email, phone, billing address, payment details, government-issued ID (for check-in), IP address, browser type, OS, referring URLs, pages visited.</p>
<p><strong>Use of Information:</strong> Process reservations, manage stays, send confirmations, promotional offers (opt-in).</p>
<p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Used to enhance browsing experience. Control via browser settings.</p>
<p><strong>Third-Party Sharing:</strong> Payment processors, booking platforms (Booking.com, MakeMyTrip, Agoda), cloud hosting, analytics. Data not sold.</p>
<p><strong>Data Security:</strong> SSL/TLS encryption, firewalls, regular security audits, strict access controls.</p>
<p><strong>Data Retention:</strong> Reservation data retained for 7 years (tax/accounting). Marketing preferences until unsubscribed.</p>
<p><strong>Your Rights:</strong> Access, correct, delete, restrict processing, data portability, withdraw consent.</p>
<p><strong>Children's Privacy:</strong> Services not directed to under 18. Contact us if child has provided data.</p>
</div>

