<p>/ (priority 1.0), /villas (0.8), /facilities (0.8), /nearby (0.8), /gallery (0.8), /about (0.8), /about/story (0.8), /about/team (0.8), /about/mission (0.8), /about/vision (0.8), /about/values (0.8), /about/awards (0.8), /about/careers (0.8), /about/sustainability (0.8), /contact (0.8), /search (0.8), /reviews (0.8), /faq (0.8), /offers (0.8), /events (0.8), /blog (0.8), /tours (0.8), /explore (0.8), /explore/experiences (0.8), /explore/nearby-attractions (0.8), /explore/tour-packages (0.8), /explore/gallery (0.8), /explore/virtual-tour (0.8)</p>
<p>Villa detail pages (3): /villas/4-bhk-villa, /villas/5-bhk-villa, /villas/7-bhk-villa (priority 0.9)</p>
